## Problem Statement

Create a GitHub Pages site that displays an interactive, auto-updating table of CFB spreads data.

## Requirements

1. Add the HTML file `cfb-spreads-table.html` to the repository (can be renamed to `index.html` for GitHub Pages default page)
2. Configure GitHub Pages to serve from the main branch
3. The HTML file should:
   - Fetch data from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/trashduty/trash-schedule/main/cfb%20model%20output_new.csv`
   - Display a sortable, searchable table with all columns
   - Apply red/green color gradients to "Cover Probability (%)" and "Edge (%)" columns (negative = red, positive = green)
   - Include a refresh button and auto-refresh every 5 minutes
   - Be fully responsive and work on mobile devices

## Implementation Details

The HTML file should be a standalone page that includes:
- All HTML structure
- Embedded CSS for styling
- Embedded JavaScript for functionality (fetching data, parsing CSV, rendering table, sorting, searching)
- No external dependencies

